{
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.char": "整座高塔都在承受重压。只要顺着墙缝挑开几根受力筋，砖石就会像旧布料一样散架。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.ancient": "狂妄的裁缝。你把我的巨构当作衣服上的线头？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.char": "结构越庞大，接缝就越多。我不仅能拆，还能给它重新打上补丁。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-3.ancient": "有趣。那就让我看看你的母版，能否盖住塔底崩塌的空洞。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.char": "高塔的接缝比上次更松了。我听见了砖石摩擦的声音。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.ancient": "只要总构架还在运转，瓦砾便只是待修剪的毛边。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.char": "毛边若不及时裁平，整匹布都会顺着经线抽丝。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-3r.ancient": "那就拿起你的巨剪，替我把多余的碎屑剪干净吧。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-attack": "Both",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "……暗港染缸里的孤僻匠人……你的十指依旧满是蓝靛与针痕……",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "染料洗不掉，手上的老茧也一样。我要去塔顶把最后的线结系上。",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "……高塔的经纬早已被腐朽浸透……唯有彻底裁剪，才能重新织就……拿起这份祝福吧……",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-3.char": "我会用最快的剪法，裁开腐烂的帷幕。",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "……听……那柄生铁巨剪的开合声，又在回廊深处响起了……",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "每一次开合，都能裁去一段旧账。",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "……愿深蓝的丝光……护佑你的针眼……",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-3r.char": "多谢。",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "快瞧瞧我从死人堆里扒出了什么！一枚纯金打造的厚实顶针，上面刻满了针眼防滑纹！",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "这可不是用来防滑的，是先古织机上调控经线密度的核心零件。",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "管它是零件还是饰品！识货的人才能发挥它的用处。拿点碎银子或者拿你那把锋利小剪来换，我不吃亏！",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-3.char": "铜钱归你，顶针归我。有了它，粗麻线也不会崩断了。",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "嘿，裁缝姑娘！今天身上带够碎布和金漆了吗？我这儿又收了几副断掉的旧剪柄！",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "给我看看成色。只要刃口没彻底崩碎，金缮都能定型。",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "哈哈哈！我就喜欢你这种拿破烂当宝贝的手艺人！挑吧挑吧！",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-3r.char": "这把断刃正好能改造成重型挑线刀。",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "潮汐在织物深处流淌。凡人的针线只能缝补皮肉，而深渊的经纬可以重塑命运。",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "我见识过暗港海水浸泡后的湿布，越是冰冷，织出的水浪纹越是紧致。",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "把你最粗糙的生铁顶针浸入渊薮……我将让幽蓝的古神光泽，永远缠绕在你的指尖。",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-3.char": "顶针散发出了黄金般温润的荧光。整架织机都在共鸣。",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "你指间的丝线变得更深邃了。准备好迎接下一道渊泉的淬炼了吗？",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "来吧，让蓝靛在深海的盐霜里彻底凝固。",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "去吧，让整座高塔见识何为天衣无缝的织造。",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-3r.char": "定不辱命。",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "每一处针孔都在流血……但正是在刺穿与撕裂之中，新的血肉与织线才能牢固纠缠。",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "裁缝从不怕针扎。拆掉溃烂的旧缝线，伤口才能长合。",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "忍住这彻骨的痛楚……把我的苦修之骨磨成挑针，去穿透那些坚硬不可摧的铠甲。",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-3.char": "骨针轻巧而森冷，一触即穿。",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "你身上的裂口又多了，但每一条缝合线都比原先更坚固。",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "这就是百衲的奥秘。补丁越多，衣服越能抗住撕扯。",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "苦痛即是养料。带着我的针骨，继续缝合你的路吧。",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-3r.char": "多谢佩尔。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "噢！多么精准利落的剪裁！你刚才挑断那具石傀儡护颈缝线的手法，简直是艺术！",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "熟能生巧罢了。再厚重的板甲，关节处也得留出活动接缝。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "不仅利落，连剪裁时散落的碎布都带着发酵蓝靛的冷艳！本夫人就欣赏懂得留白的匠人，挑选一件华美的配饰吧！",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-3.char": "这枚丝绒针插正是工坊里最缺的好物件。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "又是你，裁剪优雅的冷面姑娘！今天有没有为高塔那些粗笨的怪物量体裁衣？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "量好了尺寸，它们身上多余的护盾正一件件被我剥下来。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "精彩！继续用你的巨剪把那些丑陋的装腔作势通通裁成碎片！",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.next": "回应",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-3r.char": "正有此意。",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "哈！女人，你背着那么长的一对双刃大剪刀，走起路来却像猫一样悄无声息！",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "剪刀不是拿来砸人的。只要找准纹理顺势一推，连厚牛皮都会自己裂开。",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "阴狠！我喜欢！真正的杀戮从不比谁的吼声大，而是比谁能一刀挑中要害！拿去，这件重兵器赏给你了！",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-3.char": "多谢，它的配重很适合用来压紧幅边。",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "痛快！老子大老远就听见剪刀咔嚓咔嚓剪断肋骨的脆响！",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "有些线头太顽固，必须剪得狠一点。",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "那就剪得更彻底些！把挡路的家伙全切成肉丁！",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.next": "回应",
  "TANX.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-3r.char": "手不会抖的。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "镜面将世界一分为二。你在左侧剪下一道弧度，右侧的倒影便同步裂开对称的伤口。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "织造本就是对称的艺术。左衽与右衽严丝合缝，衣服穿在身上才不会歪斜。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "对折你的手牌吧……在镜中对称的折线里，任何残缺都将被无缝填补。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-3.char": "镜光拂过牌面，折痕化作了坚固的暗扣。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "你在镜子前停下了，裁缝。镜中的倒影正在替你理顺散乱的纬线。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "乱掉的经纬，只要在镜前对齐边缘，就能重新并线。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "看清真实的倒影，去把虚妄的敌人折叠进深渊吧。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.next": "回应",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-3r.char": "我明白了。",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "虚空之中是一团无休止缠绕的乱麻……万物在此失去起点，亦无终点。",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "只要有梭子在手，多乱的毛线也能挑出第一根主线。",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "执拗的织者……你妄图在虚无中织出秩序。那就接纳虚空的无常，将其化作你手中不可预测的飞梭吧。",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-2.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.0-3.char": "乱麻散开了，化作了一缕冰凉的青光。",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "虚空的低语又缠上了你的手腕……你还能分清哪一根是真实的丝线吗？",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "手指摸过的时候，有分量的那根就是真的。",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "那就顺着这分量走下去吧……别被空无拽落深渊。",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-2r.next": "回应",
  "VAKUU.talk.INDIGOTAILOR-INDIGO_TAILOR_CHARACTER.1-3r.char": "手中的巨剪很沉，拽不动我。"
}